    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16875" root="رهق" body-key="r">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">راهق</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">راهق الحُلُمَ</span>, (JK,
Az, K, all in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خلف</span>,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَاهَقَةٌ</span>, (Msb,)
<i>He</i> (a boy) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, near to attaining
puberty,</i> or <i>virility;</i> (S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارهق</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِرْهَاقٌ</span>. (Msb.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">راهقت العِشْرِينَ</span> [<i>She
nearly attained the</i> age of <i>twenty</i>]. (K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عصر</span>.)

